---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /portfolio/
title: "Poročne fotografije – portfolio | Jan Zorič, poročni fotograf"
description: "Izbor poročnih fotografij s porok po Sloveniji: priprave, obred, portreti in žur. Resnični trenutki, smeh in ples – brez prisiljenih poz."
bodyClass: page-portfolio
pageScript: portfolio.js
---
{#- The photos and their order come from src/_data/portfolio.yml (edited in the CMS).
    Rows are laid out by _includes/justify.njk; every 17th + 18th photo is a larger "spread". -#}
<header class="portfolio-intro">
  <h1>FOTOGRAFOV IZBOR</h1>
  <p>Zbirka mojih najljubših poročnih fotografij s porok po vsej Sloveniji.</p>
</header>

<div class="jg" data-count="{{ gallery.count }}">
  {%- for item in gallery.items %}
  <figure class="jg__item{% if item.spread %} jg__item--spread{% endif %}" style="--r: {{ item.ratio }}" data-r="{{ item.ratio }}">
    <button class="g-open" type="button" data-index="{{ item.index }}" aria-label="Povečaj fotografijo {{ item.index + 1 }} od {{ gallery.count }}">
      <img src="{{ item.src }}" alt="{{ item.alt }}"
           sizes="{% if item.spread %}(min-width: 800px) 50vw, 100vw{% else %}(min-width: 800px) 24vw, 40vw{% endif %}" eleventy:widths="320,480,800,1200,1600,2400"
           {%- if loop.index <= 6 %} loading="eager"{% endif %}{% if loop.index <= 2 %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
    </button>
    <figcaption class="frame-no" aria-hidden="true">Nº {{ item.no }}</figcaption>
  </figure>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
{% include "justify.njk" %}

<section class="outro" data-reveal>
  <p class="outro__big">OSTANE SAMO ŠE ENA STVAR.</p>
  <p><a class="bracket-link bracket-link--big" href="/kontakt/">[GREMO NA KAVO]</a></p>
</section>

<dialog class="lightbox" aria-label="Povečana fotografija">
  <img class="lightbox__img" alt="">
  <p class="lightbox__count" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <button class="lightbox__btn lightbox__close" type="button">[zapri]</button>
  <button class="lightbox__btn lightbox__prev" type="button" aria-label="Prejšnja fotografija">←</button>
  <button class="lightbox__btn lightbox__next" type="button" aria-label="Naslednja fotografija">→</button>
</dialog>
